single-seat-desktops dev session (nested wayfire, user: wftest)

  dev-install     run 10-install-wayfire-desktops.sh as root against this
                  container. Host account: droid.  Onboard: wftest.
  dev-restart     restart wayfire so it picks up the new ~/.config/wayfire.ini
                  (the window closes and reopens; do this after dev-install)
  dev-customize   run wayfire-customize.sh as wftest (no root); its
                  changes apply live to the running panel
  /repo           your working tree, read-only, live -- edit on the host

Closing the window ends the session. State is discarded with the container.
